      ":question/problem": "![](images/d9/d9c11554e0d52b7e33d58ac231de44e2d3357923717f800db94d319e87b6530e.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $AB^(\u2015)\u22a5BC^(\u2015)$ and $BD^(\u2015)\u22a5AC^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u25b3ABC\u223c\u25b3ADB$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $AB^(\u2015)\u22a5BC^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 2 | $BD^(\u2015)\u22a5AC^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 3 | $\u2220ABC$ is a right angle | {{field-1}} |\n| 4 | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| 5 | $\u2220ABC\u2245\u2220ADB$ | All right angles are congruent |\n| 6 | $\u2220A\u2245\u2220A$ | Reflexive property of congruence |\n| 7 | $\u25b3ABC\u223c\u25b3ADB$ | {{field-4}} |"
